WEBVTT

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:45.320
Looks like

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.360
things with different natures

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.360
just don't go together.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.800
Throw it away then.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:53.800
Not necessarily.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:56.640
Mr. Qing, look.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.240
Put some clay pebbles at the bottom

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.360
and then water it,

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:22.760
it'll help

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:23.680
lower the temperature.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:26.880
Plants do have their own growth cycles,

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.040
but you can work around them.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:30.680
Even if it struggles in summer,

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.800
it won't die that easily.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.560
Actually, plants are far more

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.680
resilient than we give them credit for.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.079
Go get Ye.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.200
Come with me somewhere.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.000
Mr. Qing.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:02:59.680
Meng,

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.800
you look better today.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:02.840
Dad,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.720
why did you invite him?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.240
Ruihang,

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.360
long time no see.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.560
What brings you here today?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.600
Meng,

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.800
what are you shooting for today?

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.040
Around 80, I think.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.360
Keeping it low-key, huh?

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.400
Shouldn't you be aiming for sub-70?

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.120
Mr. Qing, with you here,

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:25.800
I'm feeling the pressure.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.200
You've

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.640
always had a sweet tongue.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:30.800
Xing Wu,

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.000
how's your golf game?

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.240
Mr. Qing,

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.079
he has his studies

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.320
and work to juggle.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.240
He doesn't have time for golf.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.440
Unlike me, I got plenty of time.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.040
Mr. Qing,

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:43.360
how would you like to play?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.800
Impressive.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:00.800
Great shot.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:01.640
Nice.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:08.720
Just short.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.040
170 yards,

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.000
pin high, fried egg.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.240
Nice shot.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:14.840
That's surprising.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.120
Just got lucky.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:31.840
Beautiful.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.240
Not bad.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.000
You've got a solid swing.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.640
Just feeling it today.

00:04:52.159 --> 00:04:53.520
Oh, right,

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:54.920
what's your job?

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.400
I'm at Aofei Group.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.440
He works in aircraft design.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.600
That's a promising field.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.440
Bright future ahead.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.080
You flatter me.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.000
I'm still a graduate student,

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.760
not officially on staff yet.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:14.800
Mr. Qing,

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.440
what Xing Wu's achieved

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.280
is already remarkable.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.320
He did it all on his own.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.520
Unlike me,

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.960
nicely put, I'm following dad's footsteps.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.320
Honestly?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.640
I'm just living off him.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.840
What I admire most is

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.920
people like you and Xing Wu,

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:29.760
self-made,

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.760
everything earned through hard work.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.080
You're always good with words.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.159
We've been playing for a while.

00:05:36.159 --> 00:05:37.120
Go get us some water.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.320
Take Ye with you.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.280
Okay.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.080
Xing,

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.240
how are you so good at this?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.560
I've played a few rounds

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.720
with a client before.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.800
A few rounds and you play like this?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.200
Maybe

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.400
because growing up the way I did,

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.240
I pick things up fast.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.560
Ye's the same.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.280
Too bad

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.560
I was too caught up in work

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.760
to spend more time with her.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.520
I owe her a lot.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.040
So

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.560
I want her with someone

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.760
who'll treat her right.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:28.960
I understand.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.440
Mr. Qing, don't worry.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.760
From now on,

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.880
I'll work harder.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.200
I'll give her a better life.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.520
Remember what you said.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.640
Don't let me down.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.520
My dad's

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.280
been in business for so long.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.000
He doesn't trust people easily.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.080
Don't take it personally.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:57.840
I won't.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.520
Think about it another way.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.720
It means your dad

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.240
got to know me better.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:02.960
It's a good thing.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.240
Mr. Qing is pretty shrewd.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.960
Pretending it was just a round of golf,

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.000
but actually sizing up his future son-in-law.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.520
He even dragged me along.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.200
But congrats

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.920
on getting his approval.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.760
Thanks for today.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.160
So I

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.160
did my part

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:24.920
for your relationship.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.040
Let's set a time.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.240
I'll treat you to dinner

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.280
as thanks

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:30.200
for your help today.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:33.600
Let's put dinner on hold

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.040
until I'm back from abroad.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.000
You're going abroad?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:39.400
For further studies.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:40.840
So suddenly?

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.640
Well, he stole

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.080
my first love.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.640
So I have to leave

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.440
and heal my broken heart.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.040
Because of me?

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:50.640
When are you coming back?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.920
When I've made

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.400
something of myself.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:55.560
Alright.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.400
Come visit when you're back.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:58.600
I'll be waiting.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:07:59.520
Sure.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.800
It's still early. Wanna have some coffee?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:04.840
- I've got stuff to do.
- I've got things to do.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:09.560
Fine.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.520
I'll go by myself.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.040
Ye?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:32.799
Ruihang?

00:08:35.159 --> 00:08:36.080
I brought you breakfast.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.039
Your favorite.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.039
Thanks.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:38.760
Let's go.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:39.320
Okay.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.920
That wraps up today's tutorial

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:57.360
on this updo style.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:58.800
If you want to learn more,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.440
give me a follow,

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.040
hit that

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.640
like button,

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.600
or join my

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.600
fan club.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.560
There's a full

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.520
tutorial series.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.240
Guaranteed you'll pick it up.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:11.920
All right,

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.440
everyone, that's it

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.400
for today's stream.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.000
See you in...

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:17.760
Are you offline?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.440
Not yet, almost.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:21.360
Say hi to everyone.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:23.360
Don't forget

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.520
to like and subscribe.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:26.680
Should I cut the stream?

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:27.200
Yeah, go ahead.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.320
See you next time.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.160
Bye.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.120
Alright.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:32.880
A lot of people watched

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:33.800
your stream today.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.240
So many viewers.

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.320
Not bad, not bad.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.800
I just don't get it.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.400
Why does nobody watch

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.920
my cooking stream?

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.760
It's slow for

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.720
everyone at the start.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.200
The key is consistency.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.320
I didn't

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:49.440
have many viewers either at first,

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.360
but I kept

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.560
streaming every day.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:52.880
Then one day

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:53.800
out of nowhere

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.840
the numbers just shot up.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.480
Turns out

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.280
I had caught

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.920
the updo trend.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.520
What trend can I jump on?

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.440
Maybe stop

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.600
streaming cooking all the time.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.760
Isn't showing talent

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:09.280
and doing girl group dances

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.720
really popular these days?

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.120
Didn't you learn

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.240
dance before?

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:15.720
Film a video,

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.160
throw in some moves,

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.280
and post it.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.720
Then we can pull in

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:20.720
some followers too.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.520
That's a good idea.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.160
Right?

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.520
Then my trainee days

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.600
and dance practice

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.120
won't go to waste.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:27.520
Right.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.320
Great idea.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.360
Yeah, right.

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.360
But I can't do

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.320
a girl group dance alone.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:32.160
How about

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.520
you two join me?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:34.960
Us two?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.600
I can't dance.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:37.440
Count me out.

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:38.320
I...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:38.880
I...

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.040
I can help with the hair.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.600
But dancing? Please spare me.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:49.040
I'm going to miss you.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:50.640
Me too.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.160
We'll see each other tomorrow.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:10:59.320
Hello?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.520
[Wu, I need a favor.]

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:02.520
What's up?

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.520
[I met a girl I really like.]

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.000
[I wanna bring her over for a movie,]

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.720
[but I don't want my sister to find out.]

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.520
[Can I crash at your place tonight?]

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:11.440
When did this happen?

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.640
[Just a couple days ago.]

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.440
[We're still chatting.]

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.240
[Come on, yes or no?]

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.280
If you're at my place,

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:19.520
where do I go?

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.320
[Please work something out.]

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:29.840
Fine.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.760
I'll send you the door lock code.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:32.720
[Thanks.]

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.040
I bought this not long ago.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.160
It should fit you.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:09.560
Okay.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:10.640
I'll go take a shower.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:12.840
Bathroom's over there.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.240
Well,

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.640
toothbrush

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.680
and hair dryer

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:34.160
are in the drawer.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.760
You'll see them when you open it.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.040
Okay.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:45.800
I see them.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.400
Let me know if you need anything else.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:50.400
Okay.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.120
[Save me]

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.200
[a seat at the main table.]

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:25.840
[Congratulations.]

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:27.880
[Wu,]

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.360
[bring Ye back during the holiday.]

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:32.880
[Finally got your girl.]

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.120
[That's it!]

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:36.920
[When you love someone, you say it.]

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.280
[When's the wedding?]

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.320
Ye?

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.240
Ye?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.760
I love you.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:50.640
I love you too.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.920
So the dance...

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:53.520
What's up?

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:55.440
Wait, you didn't hit the button.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.800
You didn't even hit the button.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.560
You didn't press the round button.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.160
What are you doing, Cici?

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.320
I quit.

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:02.040
I've been working all day.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.040
My husband finally came home.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.200
I need to go back.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.120
Just do it one more time.

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:05.800
No.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.040
My husband's waiting for me at home.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.200
I'm exhausted.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.080
Just dance one more with me.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:09.680
Lanfang,

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:11.160
check this out.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.200
Wu posted something on Moments.

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:14.000
Really?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:14.960
- What's going on?
- What did he post?

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.200
Wait.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.360
Is he going public with his relationship?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.400
Who is it, anyway?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.640
Just two backs of hands.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:25.160
Who can tell who that is? Silly boy.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.920
Ye?

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.240
Lanfang,

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:33.240
shouldn't you be treating us to dinner?

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.200
No problem.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.520
I should.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.960
But what excuse

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.040
can I use to get them

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.520
to come back?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.080
Dance and make our group debut.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.560
Then maybe they shouldn't come back.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.160
Wait.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.320
Isn't the Dragon Boat Festival coming soon?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.520
Tell them to come back for the holiday meal.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.000
Then we can ask

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.120
if this is actually true.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:54.800
Good idea.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.320
It won't get in the way of their work.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:56.920
Exactly.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:57.520
I'll ask them right now.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:58.080
No, wait.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.240
Dance with me one more time first.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.600
I can't dance now.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.520
I'm making the call.

00:17:19.839 --> 00:17:20.280
Hello?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.280
[Wu,]

00:17:21.599 --> 00:17:22.800
[I saw your post.]

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.640
[You're off for Dragon Boat Festival?]

00:17:24.839 --> 00:17:26.200
[Bring Ye back for the holiday.]

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:28.640
Okay.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:30.600
I...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.120
I'll ask her.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.120
I'll tell her about it.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:52.880
Go take it.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.320
Hello, Mr. Zhu?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.600
Are you calling for the gossip too?

00:17:58.760 --> 00:17:59.960
[What gossip?]

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.000
[I'm calling about something serious.]

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:02.320
Go ahead. What's it?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:03.760
[I heard from your mom]

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.320
[you'll be back for the holiday,]

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:05.800
[right?]

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.200
If you're coming back,

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.960
make some time to drop by school.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.760
Talk to the kids

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.240
in senior year.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.440
[Share some thoughts.]

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.320
[Give them a speech.]

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.120
[You're an outstanding graduate.]

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:16.880
[Set an example]

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:17.840
[and encourage them.]

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.280
What kind of role model am I?

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.080
[Why not?]

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:22.840
[For the first three years,]

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.680
[you were the classic bad student.]

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:25.800
For the last three,

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.240
you turned it all around.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.520
Either way,

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.800
no one fits better than you.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.320
Thanks a lot.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.160
You don't know this, Wu.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.880
These kids

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:35.680
are different

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:36.600
from your year.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.160
They don't want

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.040
the boring

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.520
lectures anymore.

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:42.360
[They like stories about troubled kids]

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.520
[who got back on track.]

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:45.360
[Tell them the trouble you made]

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.520
[and how you changed.]

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.360
Isn't that great?

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:48.240
All right.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:48.960
Fine.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:49.520
I'll go.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:50.560
I'll go, Old Zhu.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.160
[Perfect. Then it's settled.]

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.400
Why do they

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.000
have to call now?

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.560
That's what you get

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.520
for making us official tonight.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:09.880
I was too impatient.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.120
My mom asked if you

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:17.720
have time on Dragon Boat Festival.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.720
She wants me to bring you home.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:23.880
I'm free.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:25.360
I just don't know

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.520
if Auntie can accept

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.880
us being together.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.040
She definitely can.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.400
She'll be thrilled.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:32.360
Thrilled?

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.640
Her niece becomes her son's girlfriend.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:37.840
She's okay with that?

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:41.920
Don't worry.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.520
My mom's pretty chill.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.640
And she figured it out long ago.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:47.240
Really?

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.440
No wonder

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.360
that time I went back,

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:51.000
she said she had to go into town.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:53.880
Right,

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.600
what did Mr. Zhu say?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:56.680
Something about going back to school?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.520
He wants me to give a speech

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.560
to the graduating class.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:01.920
That's great.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:03.840
Look at you.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.320
A bottom-of-the-class kid

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:07.400
transformed from

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:12.040
a student on leave to an outstanding graduate,

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.040
and now,

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.360
what do they call it,

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:17.400
a rising star

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.800
in aerospace.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.800
What a story.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.120
It all started

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.120
when a girl lost everything

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.880
and ended up at Zhazhating.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.200
That's a good opening.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.320
Use that.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:38.680
But before that,

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.760
we need to talk

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:41.600
about us.

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:44.840
I heard Wu's bringing

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:45.960
his girlfriend home this time.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.360
It's his first girlfriend,

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.640
and she's from the big city.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.440
I can't let her feel unwelcome.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:53.080
Look.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:53.720
I even

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.040
bought a new outfit.

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:55.800
Does it look nice?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:56.840
I can tell.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:57.400
The necklace

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:58.560
I gave you goes perfectly with it.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.080
I think so too.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:01.920
Does this outfit

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:02.520
make me look

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.520
very cultured?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:04.640
Of course.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.240
Lanfang,

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.200
I keep wondering

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.720
what kind of girl

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:10.880
Xing Wu would date.

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:13.360
Maybe she's

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:13.840
a researcher

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:15.200
who builds rockets

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:18.760
and wear heavy glasses.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:21.040
You'll know when you meet her.

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:41.840
Auntie!

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:42.880
Come give me a hug.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:45.200
I missed you so much.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:46.520
I told you not to come

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:47.400
all the way to pick us up.

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:48.960
How could I not come?

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.000
Mr. Zhu drove me here

00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:50.600
Where is he?

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:51.280
Where is he?

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:52.680
Parking's hard here.

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:53.840
He's waiting outside.

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:55.000
We'll give him a surprise later.

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:56.600
A surprise?

00:22:57.560 --> 00:22:58.440
More like a scare.

00:22:59.000 --> 00:22:59.960
Look at you.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.840
Finally.

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:02.840
You liked her for so long,

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:04.040
and only now you said it.

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:05.720
Auntie,

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:07.720
I didn't expect you'd seen it all along.

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:09.360
I was worried

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:10.720
you wouldn't

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:12.200
accept us being together.

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:13.640
Told you so.

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:15.120
My mom figured it out ages ago.

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:16.880
Of course. Nothing gets past me.

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:18.280
Let's go.

00:23:18.280 --> 00:23:18.840
You happy?

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:19.720
Beyond happy.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:20.400
Let's go home.

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:21.080
Come on.

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:46.680
Everyone,

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:47.880
here's the big one.

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:48.960
Exclusive deals

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:50.640
for our stream today.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:51.360
Buy one

00:23:51.520 --> 00:23:53.400
jin of fried fish fillets today,

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:55.680
and get one jin of dried fish for free.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:56.800
Is that enough?

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:57.960
Not enough.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:23:59.520
Our pretty chef says it's not enough.

00:23:59.640 --> 00:23:59.960
All right.

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:02.400
We'll make it two jin of dried fish.

00:24:02.800 --> 00:24:03.920
That's a steal.

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.280
Look. We change

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:07.280
our oil every day.

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:08.520
Guys,

00:24:08.560 --> 00:24:10.320
no additives,

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:11.560
all natural,

00:24:12.120 --> 00:24:13.480
and won't cause any irritation.

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:15.280
Safe for kids and seniors

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:16.040
alike.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:17.080
Three,

00:24:17.800 --> 00:24:18.440
two,

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:19.800
one.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.120
Link's up!

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:23.840
Grandma,

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:25.840
we came to see you.

00:24:30.600 --> 00:24:31.360
We have

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:33.760
something important

00:24:34.680 --> 00:24:35.520
to tell you today.

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:41.480
Grandma,

00:24:42.720 --> 00:24:43.200
look.

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:45.680
We're together now.

00:25:05.040 --> 00:25:05.760
Wu.

00:25:07.560 --> 00:25:08.200
Grandma,

00:25:10.280 --> 00:25:11.400
time to go back.

00:25:11.680 --> 00:25:12.360
It's getting cold out here.

00:25:14.240 --> 00:25:14.880
Wu,

00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:18.120
are you thinking about Ye too,

00:25:18.720 --> 00:25:20.280
just like I am?

00:25:27.160 --> 00:25:28.720
Even if you don't say it, I know.

00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:31.520
Sometimes people

00:25:31.840 --> 00:25:33.040
are like the wind.

00:25:33.600 --> 00:25:35.200
They come

00:25:35.720 --> 00:25:37.440
and go.

00:25:38.240 --> 00:25:39.960
If you want to see someone again,

00:25:40.560 --> 00:25:42.840
you have to chase them hard.

00:25:49.360 --> 00:25:50.560
You're still young.

00:25:51.760 --> 00:25:53.520
You have a long road ahead.

00:25:54.200 --> 00:25:55.560
Don't get stuck here

00:25:55.680 --> 00:25:56.680
like me.

00:25:57.760 --> 00:25:59.160
Go out there.

00:25:59.440 --> 00:26:00.920
Keep going.

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:04.400
See the world

00:26:04.840 --> 00:26:06.320
for me,

00:26:06.960 --> 00:26:07.640
okay?

00:26:12.760 --> 00:26:13.360
Grandma,

00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:14.640
I promise.

00:26:16.520 --> 00:26:17.240
Grandma,

00:26:18.920 --> 00:26:20.600
Wu has become an outstanding man.

00:26:21.640 --> 00:26:23.040
He didn't let you down.

00:26:23.560 --> 00:26:24.680
You can rest in peace now.

00:26:32.360 --> 00:26:33.320
Rest easy, Grandma.

00:26:43.400 --> 00:26:44.640
Grandma started knitting

00:26:46.000 --> 00:26:47.600
this scarf for you before she passed.

00:26:52.600 --> 00:26:53.280
So

00:26:56.400 --> 00:26:57.520
you finished it?

00:27:03.920 --> 00:27:04.520
Grandma,

00:27:04.800 --> 00:27:05.920
I know how to knit scarves now.

00:27:09.600 --> 00:27:10.440
Thank you, Grandma.

00:27:12.080 --> 00:27:13.360
I really love this gift.

00:27:22.600 --> 00:27:23.160
How is it?

00:27:23.640 --> 00:27:24.400
Looking good, right?

00:27:24.600 --> 00:27:25.160
Not bad.

00:27:28.880 --> 00:27:29.320
No, no.

00:27:29.320 --> 00:27:30.560
The filling's spilling out.

00:27:30.600 --> 00:27:31.720
You put in too much.

00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:33.520
Here, take some out.

00:27:33.720 --> 00:27:34.880
You can't wrap it like that.

00:27:35.160 --> 00:27:36.360
They're just dating.

00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:37.200
Why do you

00:27:37.240 --> 00:27:38.440
look so worried?

00:27:42.040 --> 00:27:44.280
I am a little worried.

00:27:44.880 --> 00:27:45.600
Why?

00:27:45.600 --> 00:27:46.640
What's there to worry about?

00:27:46.720 --> 00:27:48.520
You've always known

00:27:48.520 --> 00:27:50.120
Wu likes Ye.

00:27:50.240 --> 00:27:51.120
Yeah.

00:27:51.360 --> 00:27:52.320
And they're

00:27:52.320 --> 00:27:53.520
not related by blood.

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:55.120
They're not siblings.

00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:56.240
Young people falling in love

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:57.400
is a good thing.

00:27:57.400 --> 00:27:58.560
What are you worried about?

00:28:00.160 --> 00:28:01.680
What worries me is...

00:28:03.040 --> 00:28:04.520
I'm happy they're

00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:05.200
together.

00:28:05.520 --> 00:28:06.520
I'm happy for them.

00:28:07.080 --> 00:28:08.240
But I think

00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:09.560
the gap between our families

00:28:09.560 --> 00:28:10.800
is huge.

00:28:11.360 --> 00:28:13.680
You're worrying too much.

00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:15.000
What matters is that

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:16.200
they like each other.

00:28:16.520 --> 00:28:17.520
Exactly.

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:19.720
And Wu is excellent too.

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:22.120
Tall, handsome, motivated,

00:28:22.360 --> 00:28:23.560
and skilled at high tech stuff.

00:28:23.960 --> 00:28:25.640
He has a great future ahead.

00:28:26.600 --> 00:28:27.640
They'll bring out

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:30.080
the best in each other.

00:28:30.800 --> 00:28:31.800
So don't worry.

00:28:32.520 --> 00:28:33.640
They’re adults now.

00:28:33.760 --> 00:28:34.520
They can

00:28:34.520 --> 00:28:36.400
make their own decisions.

00:28:36.560 --> 00:28:37.880
Stop worrying about them.

00:28:37.960 --> 00:28:38.920
Just let it be.

00:28:39.080 --> 00:28:39.680
All right.

00:28:41.080 --> 00:28:42.760
Hearing you two say that

00:28:43.160 --> 00:28:44.560
really makes me feel

00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:46.120
much better.

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:47.600
Fine.

00:28:48.040 --> 00:28:49.240
Let it be.

00:28:49.600 --> 00:28:50.240
I'll

00:28:50.560 --> 00:28:51.280
give them my blessing.

00:28:51.520 --> 00:28:51.880
Right.

00:28:52.200 --> 00:28:53.840
Let's wish them well.

00:28:54.280 --> 00:28:55.240
Let's wrap the zongzi.

00:28:55.280 --> 00:28:56.080
Let's do it.

00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:00.840
We can stay a few more days this time.

00:29:01.080 --> 00:29:02.560
You can eat everything you've been

00:29:02.640 --> 00:29:03.320
craving,

00:29:03.680 --> 00:29:04.320
like salted fish cakes,

00:29:04.800 --> 00:29:05.520
- and seafood noodles.
- Yeah.

00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:06.040
Right.

00:29:06.120 --> 00:29:07.720
And the steamed egg with sea urchin here

00:29:07.760 --> 00:29:08.600
has to be different.

00:29:08.680 --> 00:29:09.200
It's fresh.

00:29:12.440 --> 00:29:13.160
- You're here?
- Wu.

00:29:13.520 --> 00:29:13.960
Ye.

00:29:13.960 --> 00:29:15.400
Wu, Ye!

00:29:15.520 --> 00:29:16.120
Shi Min?

00:29:16.920 --> 00:29:18.600
Come to my place for seafood noodles.

00:29:19.080 --> 00:29:20.240
Your ears are sharp.

00:29:20.240 --> 00:29:20.840
See?

00:29:22.840 --> 00:29:23.400
Wu,

00:29:23.760 --> 00:29:24.200
Ye.

00:29:24.400 --> 00:29:25.520
Quanya, long time no see.

00:29:25.600 --> 00:29:26.160
Long time no see.

00:29:26.360 --> 00:29:27.000
Congratulations.

00:29:27.520 --> 00:29:28.520
Han asked me

00:29:28.880 --> 00:29:29.960
to give you these gifts

00:29:30.320 --> 00:29:32.080
with her blessing.

00:29:32.720 --> 00:29:33.520
Thank Han for us.

00:29:33.960 --> 00:29:34.920
How is she?

00:29:35.240 --> 00:29:36.320
She's doing great.

00:29:36.520 --> 00:29:38.200
She's doing business overseas with Yingjian.

00:29:39.600 --> 00:29:40.120
Then,

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:41.440
let's head inside.

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:42.600
Auntie's waiting for us.

00:29:42.880 --> 00:29:43.240
Let's go.

00:29:43.280 --> 00:29:44.400
- Come on.
- Let's eat.

00:29:44.600 --> 00:29:45.280
Go.

00:29:47.720 --> 00:29:51.000
Cheers! Happy Dragon Boat Festival!

00:29:51.160 --> 00:29:51.840
This is nice.

00:29:54.800 --> 00:29:55.400
Let's eat.

00:29:56.720 --> 00:29:58.360
What a feast today.

00:29:59.920 --> 00:30:00.640
You know,

00:30:00.880 --> 00:30:02.320
we, as elders,

00:30:03.320 --> 00:30:04.760
watch you kids

00:30:04.840 --> 00:30:05.960
grow up day by day.

00:30:06.320 --> 00:30:07.280
Now you've made something of yourselves.

00:30:08.000 --> 00:30:08.680
It really

00:30:09.040 --> 00:30:10.880
puts our hearts at ease.

00:30:11.360 --> 00:30:12.520
Exactly.

00:30:12.680 --> 00:30:14.240
The kids are doing well,

00:30:14.560 --> 00:30:16.400
and we don't have to worry about them.

00:30:16.400 --> 00:30:16.840
Right.

00:30:17.160 --> 00:30:18.160
Look at Big G and Shi Min.

00:30:18.520 --> 00:30:19.520
Those two are

00:30:19.520 --> 00:30:21.080
doing great together.

00:30:21.080 --> 00:30:22.440
Mainly because I stayed out of it.

00:30:23.360 --> 00:30:24.920
They're all doing

00:30:25.160 --> 00:30:25.880
pretty well.

00:30:26.120 --> 00:30:27.360
Exactly. Big G,

00:30:27.520 --> 00:30:28.240
you became a teacher

00:30:28.400 --> 00:30:29.880
and got married this year.

00:30:29.880 --> 00:30:30.640
Two milestones in one year.

00:30:30.720 --> 00:30:31.840
Come on. Make a toast.

00:30:32.520 --> 00:30:33.360
I will.

00:30:34.320 --> 00:30:35.120
Then let me

