00:30:47.840 --> 00:30:50.600
My livestream shopping account

00:30:51.200 --> 00:30:53.400
just hit 100,000 followers.

00:30:55.880 --> 00:30:57.400
You're a big influencer now.

00:30:57.560 --> 00:30:59.680
