00:31:14.840 --> 00:31:15.760
Cheers.

00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:17.320
Keep it up.

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:18.120
Okay.

00:31:18.240 --> 00:31:18.960
You got this.

00:31:22.360 --> 00:31:23.200
