00:31:23.560 --> 00:31:24.560
I'm happy today.

00:31:24.800 --> 00:31:25.680
That's enough.

00:31:26.440 --> 00:31:27.800
That's impressive.

00:31:28.800 --> 00:31:30.160
- Nice!
- Nice!

