- He should make a toast too.

00:31:33.320 --> 00:31:33.920
This year,

00:31:34.520 --> 00:31:35.160
I got married.

00:31:35.520 --> 00:31:36.640
You all witnessed it.

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:39.880
And it's my first year as a teacher.

00:31:40.200 --> 00:31:41.640
I've always wanted to thank

00:31:42.680 --> 00:31:44.120
two persons for helping me get here.

00:31:44.720 --> 00:31:45.920
Back then, if you hadn't

00:31:45.920 --> 00:31:46.920
been there with me through the gaokao,

00:31:47.280 --> 00:31:48.360
I never would've gone to

00:31:48.360 --> 00:31:49.000
the same

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:50.160
college as Min.

00:31:51.880 --> 00:31:52.520
This one's to you.

00:31:53.160 --> 00:31:54.680
We were in it together.

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:56.720
Bottoms up.

00:32:01.880 --> 00:32:02.640
Nice.

00:32:03.160 --> 00:32:04.120
That's cool.

00:32:04.160 --> 00:32:05.000
What do you mean?

00:32:05.560 --> 00:32:06.760
