00:32:09.280 --> 00:32:10.920
and leaving me out?

00:32:11.720 --> 00:32:13.160
You have the nerve to complain?

00:32:13.280 --> 00:32:14.160
Look at them.

00:32:14.520 --> 00:32:15.520
One's got a girlfriend.

00:32:15.560 --> 00:32:16.560
The other is married.

00:32:16.840 --> 00:32:18.000
Then look at you.

00:32:18.240 --> 00:32:20.000
All you think about

00:32:20.040 --> 00:32:20.520
every day

00:32:20.520 --> 00:32:21.520
is just cars.

00:32:21.560 --> 00:32:22.800
If I were them,

00:32:23.080 --> 00:32:24.160
I wouldn't include you either.

00:32:24.160 --> 00:32:24.520
Right.

00:32:24.560 --> 00:32:25.280
