00:32:31.560 --> 00:32:32.520
Exactly.

00:32:33.040 --> 00:32:34.120
Ye gets me.

00:32:34.680 --> 00:32:35.200
Love you.

00:32:36.440 --> 00:32:36.920
Oh, come on.

00:32:36.920 --> 00:32:37.920
Go find a girlfriend soon.

00:32:38.200 --> 00:32:38.640
Right.

00:32:44.160 --> 00:32:44.680
Han,

00:32:44.920 --> 00:32:46.000
I'm spending the holiday at Wu's place.

00:32:47.040 --> 00:32:47.600
Hi, Han.

00:32:47.640 --> 00:32:48.120
Hello.

00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:48.760
Han.

00:32:48.760 --> 00:32:49.920
Wow, so many people.

00:32:49.920 --> 00:32:50.400
Hi.

00:32:50.440 --> 00:32:51.040
Hi.

00:32:51.120 --> 00:32:51.840
Everyone, long time

00:32:51.840 --> 00:32:52.720
no see.

00:32:53.640 --> 00:32:54.200
Look

00:32:54.360 --> 00:32:55.160
who it is.

00:32:56.680 --> 00:32:57.520
Hey everyone,

00:32:57.800 --> 00:32:58.640
