00:33:04.280 --> 00:33:04.920
Ye,

00:33:05.240 --> 00:33:06.440
you and Wu are

00:33:06.440 --> 00:33:08.080
always meant to be.

00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:09.240
Congratulations.

00:33:09.440 --> 00:33:10.120
Thank you.

00:33:10.720 --> 00:33:12.000
Mr. Ye, when are you coming back?

00:33:12.400 --> 00:33:13.720
Still keeping an eye on a few projects.

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:14.680
I'll go back once I'm done.

00:33:15.120 --> 00:33:15.600
Okay.

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:16.600
When you return,

00:33:17.000 --> 00:33:17.760
let's get together.

00:33:19.520 --> 00:33:20.120
Han,

00:33:20.280 --> 00:33:21.280
