00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:23.720
You need to take care of yourself.

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:24.520
Really?

00:33:24.560 --> 00:33:25.600
Did I get thinner?

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:27.080
Don't worry.

00:33:27.160 --> 00:33:28.360
I still wanna chase my dreams

00:33:28.360 --> 00:33:29.360
while I'm young.

00:33:29.560 --> 00:33:31.320
She used to want to stay close to home.

00:33:31.640 --> 00:33:32.200
Now she

00:33:32.680 --> 00:33:33.800
barely comes back once a year.

00:33:34.760 --> 00:33:35.600
People change.

00:33:36.080 --> 00:33:36.960
Han said the same thing.

00:33:37.960 --> 00:33:39.440
Women are so unpredictable.

00:33:41.520 --> 00:33:42.400
Who said I changed?

00:33:42.680 --> 00:33:43.640
What did I change?

00:33:43.880 --> 00:33:45.240
I'm still the same.

00:33:45.240 --> 00:33:46.720
All I think about is making money.

00:33:46.760 --> 00:33:47.800
I'm just

00:33:47.800 --> 00:33:48.840
in a different place.

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:50.760
Han, don't listen to them.

00:33:50.800 --> 00:33:51.560
You haven't changed.

00:33:51.840 --> 00:33:53.520
Let me give you a toast.

00:33:53.720 --> 00:33:55.720
May your life be boundless

00:33:55.880 --> 00:33:57.160
and full of possibility.

00:33:57.320 --> 00:33:57.800
Cheers.

00:33:57.880 --> 00:33:58.680
Mr. Ye,

00:33:59.040 --> 00:33:59.760
