00:34:00.080 --> 00:34:00.640
Okay.

00:34:00.880 --> 00:34:01.520
One second.

00:34:01.760 --> 00:34:02.560
We

00:34:02.880 --> 00:34:03.880
have a meeting soon.

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:05.880
We'll catch up another time.

00:34:06.440 --> 00:34:07.960
Ye, thank you for the toast.

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:08.560
Same to you.

00:34:09.440 --> 00:34:10.639
I'll go back to work then.

00:34:10.840 --> 00:34:11.960
Bye for now. Talk later.

00:34:11.960 --> 00:34:12.679
Bye, Han.

00:34:12.679 --> 00:34:13.159
Bye.

00:34:13.239 --> 00:34:13.760
Bye.

00:34:13.920 --> 00:34:14.719
Bye.

00:34:14.840 --> 00:34:15.560
Bye.

00:34:15.560 --> 00:34:16.120
Bye.

00:34:16.760 --> 00:34:17.560
Bye, Han.

00:34:19.679 --> 00:34:20.199
Wu,

00:34:20.679 --> 00:34:21.719
say a few words.

00:34:24.199 --> 00:34:24.840
My turn?

00:34:28.800 --> 00:34:29.880
Actually, when Ye

00:34:30.760 --> 00:34:31.679
left five years ago,

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:33.880
I imagined what it

00:34:33.880 --> 00:34:35.520
would be like to see her again many times.

00:34:36.560 --> 00:34:37.400
And now

00:34:40.400 --> 00:34:41.920
it's finally happened.

00:34:44.120 --> 00:34:45.920
Oh, stop showing off.

00:34:46.440 --> 00:34:48.000
They're holding hands.

00:34:48.320 --> 00:34:49.679
This past year has been

00:34:50.159 --> 00:34:51.520
a dream come true for me.

00:34:52.679 --> 00:34:53.520
I'm lucky.

00:34:54.840 --> 00:34:55.719
And I'm happy.

00:34:56.239 --> 00:34:56.840
Good.

00:34:56.920 --> 00:34:57.440
Drink.

00:34:58.800 --> 00:34:59.600
I'll drink it up.

00:35:01.520 --> 00:35:02.200
That little?

00:35:02.520 --> 00:35:03.880
Come on, give me your glass.

00:35:05.200 --> 00:35:06.080
If he gets drunk,

00:35:06.080 --> 00:35:06.720
how's he getting home?

00:35:06.720 --> 00:35:07.520
That's enough.

00:35:07.720 --> 00:35:09.520
He's got Ye to take care of him.

00:35:14.440 --> 00:35:16.080
Not bad.

00:35:16.520 --> 00:35:17.520
That's the spirit.

00:35:17.520 --> 00:35:19.000
You can really hold your liquor.

00:35:21.520 --> 00:35:23.000
Honestly, before I came here,

00:35:23.720 --> 00:35:25.000
I never imagined

00:35:25.640 --> 00:35:26.680
so much

00:35:26.680 --> 00:35:27.600
would happen.

00:35:28.720 --> 00:35:29.240
Yeah.

00:35:30.440 --> 00:35:31.160
I remember

00:35:31.160 --> 00:35:32.360
when you first got here,

00:35:32.360 --> 00:35:33.320
you weren't used to anything here,

00:35:33.520 --> 00:35:34.400
not the food,

00:35:34.520 --> 00:35:35.400
not the place.

00:35:35.760 --> 00:35:36.920
Nothing felt right to you.

00:35:37.400 --> 00:35:38.440
I still remember

00:35:38.800 --> 00:35:39.520
the second day she was here,

00:35:39.520 --> 00:35:40.720
her eyes swollen and her ankle twisted,

00:35:40.800 --> 00:35:41.400
right?

00:35:41.760 --> 00:35:43.400
All I remember is Xing Wu

00:35:43.640 --> 00:35:45.000
picking on me every day.

00:35:45.080 --> 00:35:46.280
When did I pick on you?

00:35:46.320 --> 00:35:47.840
You were so hard to deal with back then.

00:35:47.960 --> 00:35:48.920
Say that again?

00:35:50.880 --> 00:35:52.360
But I slowly

00:35:52.880 --> 00:35:55.520
started to fit into life here.

00:35:56.800 --> 00:35:57.800
I gradually

00:35:58.360 --> 00:35:59.000
made friends.

00:35:59.640 --> 00:36:00.880
♪Two little bees♪

00:36:01.120 --> 00:36:02.320
♪fly among the flowers.♪

00:36:02.320 --> 00:36:03.520
♪Flying left, then flying right.♪

00:36:04.040 --> 00:36:06.760
Also, I've gained a family.

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:09.520
Bit by bit, I learned

00:36:10.280 --> 00:36:12.040
the difference between wheat and weeds.

00:36:12.800 --> 00:36:13.640
And gradually

00:36:13.960 --> 00:36:15.800
I've realized there are things

00:36:16.080 --> 00:36:17.720
money just can't buy.

00:36:20.120 --> 00:36:21.800
Auntie, you love mahjong

00:36:22.600 --> 00:36:23.920
Sometimes you get a great hand,

00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:25.080
sometimes you

00:36:25.400 --> 00:36:26.600
start with a terrible one.

00:36:27.360 --> 00:36:28.440
But no matter what,

00:36:28.640 --> 00:36:30.880
even if you're dealt a bad hand,

00:36:31.640 --> 00:36:32.520
play

00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:34.440
your best and win.

00:36:34.600 --> 00:36:35.760
Well said.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:37.040
Now you've got it.

00:36:37.040 --> 00:36:37.600
- Come on.
- Anyway,

00:36:37.600 --> 00:36:39.080
wish you all peace and health.

00:36:39.640 --> 00:36:40.320
Happy holidays.

00:36:40.640 --> 00:36:43.160
Happy holidays. Cheers.

00:36:43.160 --> 00:36:44.120
Happy holidays.

00:36:47.880 --> 00:36:49.160
It's rare we're all together.

00:36:49.360 --> 00:36:50.240
Let's take a group photo.

00:36:50.600 --> 00:36:51.720
- Great idea.
- Come on.

00:36:54.200 --> 00:36:55.400
Three, two, one.

00:37:08.520 --> 00:37:10.640
Time really flies.

00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:12.440
Tata's gotten so big.

00:37:13.400 --> 00:37:15.320
And so many new faces too.

00:37:15.800 --> 00:37:16.760
In cat years,

00:37:17.520 --> 00:37:19.360
Tata's actually middle-aged,

00:37:19.680 --> 00:37:20.720
older than both of us.

00:37:22.360 --> 00:37:23.280
You can't compare like that.

00:37:23.280 --> 00:37:24.520
I'm nowhere near middle-aged.

00:37:24.880 --> 00:37:26.640
I'm forever 18 years old.

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:26.960
Make a wish.

00:38:32.960 --> 00:38:34.560
I wanna spend every day

00:38:35.240 --> 00:38:36.520
of my life with you.

00:38:39.280 --> 00:38:40.080
We will.

00:38:51.320 --> 00:38:52.960
I wish this night

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:55.040
would never end.

00:38:59.200 --> 00:38:59.840
Me too.

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:08.800
Oh right,

00:39:09.240 --> 00:39:10.640
how's that speech Mr. Zhu asked you

00:39:10.640 --> 00:39:11.640
to prepare coming along?

00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:15.080
I came up with an opening.

00:39:15.680 --> 00:39:16.800
Hear this out.

00:39:17.680 --> 00:39:18.520
Six years ago,

00:39:19.120 --> 00:39:20.160
I was a troublemaker.

00:39:22.400 --> 00:39:23.440
Who starts a speech

00:39:23.440 --> 00:39:24.560
by putting themselves down?

00:39:25.000 --> 00:39:26.400
I'm setting up the contrast.

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:30.120
What did I write after that?

00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:31.040
Let me think.

00:39:48.120 --> 00:39:48.920
Six years ago,

00:39:49.960 --> 00:39:51.000
I was a troublemaker.

00:39:53.400 --> 00:39:53.840
The kind

00:39:53.840 --> 00:39:55.600
teachers described as

00:39:56.440 --> 00:39:57.840
unfriendly to classmates

00:39:58.520 --> 00:40:00.080
and cold toward teachers.

00:40:01.080 --> 00:40:02.040
Back then, I thought

00:40:02.560 --> 00:40:04.240
some things just couldn't be changed.

00:40:05.080 --> 00:40:06.520
No matter how hard I tried,

00:40:07.000 --> 00:40:08.200
it was pointless.

00:40:08.920 --> 00:40:09.840
So I just

00:40:11.240 --> 00:40:12.760
gave up fighting

00:40:13.120 --> 00:40:14.080
and accepted my fate.

00:40:17.200 --> 00:40:18.400
But later, I realized

00:40:18.520 --> 00:40:19.160
I was wrong.

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:21.080
Someone

00:40:22.040 --> 00:40:23.080
once told me

00:40:23.440 --> 00:40:25.400
Those painful days

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:28.400
are like mud when the tide pulls back.

00:40:28.440 --> 00:40:29.520
It looks messy,

00:40:30.200 --> 00:40:30.920
but

00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:34.120
when the sun comes up,

00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:36.360
the broken shells catch

00:40:36.800 --> 00:40:37.800
the light and shimmer.

00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:39.280
These experiences

00:40:40.960 --> 00:40:41.520
are what

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:43.680
shape you and make you unique.

00:40:49.640 --> 00:40:51.240
She knew there was a fire burning in me.

00:40:55.640 --> 00:40:57.080
[I never wanted to be ordinary.]

00:40:59.080 --> 00:41:00.320
[I wanted to make something of myself.]

00:41:01.840 --> 00:41:02.960
[I had dreams too.]

00:41:06.080 --> 00:41:07.520
[They felt so out of reach,]

00:41:10.640 --> 00:41:11.680
[but I'm glad]

00:41:14.280 --> 00:41:15.840
[I never stopped]

00:41:15.840 --> 00:41:17.520
[chasing them.]

00:41:20.240 --> 00:41:20.960
[Run forward.]

00:41:22.040 --> 00:41:22.720
[Don't look back.]

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:26.360
[Like all of you,]

00:41:27.640 --> 00:41:28.920
[someone saw potential in me.]

00:41:29.880 --> 00:41:30.760
[And I believe]

00:41:32.600 --> 00:41:33.880
[I can fight my way to a better life.]

00:41:39.240 --> 00:41:40.040
She also told me

00:41:42.040 --> 00:41:43.960
no one is born inferior.

00:41:45.200 --> 00:41:46.640
We all have it in us to shine.

00:41:51.120 --> 00:41:51.800
I believe her.

00:41:54.920 --> 00:41:56.680
And I believe everyone here

00:41:57.880 --> 00:41:59.080
can have

00:42:00.080 --> 00:42:01.320
a brilliant future.

00:42:34.800 --> 00:42:35.920
[A lot of people say]

00:42:36.720 --> 00:42:39.520
[I changed Xing Wu.]

00:42:41.360 --> 00:42:42.120
[But he]

00:42:43.080 --> 00:42:44.400
[changed me just as much.]

00:42:46.120 --> 00:42:47.320
[Before I met him,]

00:42:48.200 --> 00:42:49.880
[I thought there was only one way]

00:42:49.880 --> 00:42:50.640
[life could shine,]

00:42:52.280 --> 00:42:53.440
[fearless, passionate,]

00:42:54.040 --> 00:42:54.960
[with no restraint.]

00:42:56.680 --> 00:42:57.600
[After I met him,]

00:42:57.600 --> 00:42:58.400
[I learned that]

00:42:59.960 --> 00:43:02.040
[weeds grow from ash,]

00:43:03.520 --> 00:43:06.120
[sunlight seeps through cracks,]

00:43:07.280 --> 00:43:09.200
[ordinary life has its beauty,]

00:43:10.240 --> 00:43:12.920
[and that hope can rise from despair.]

00:43:14.440 --> 00:43:16.840
[That is the power of life.]

00:43:36.520 --> 00:43:38.240
Cheese.